post.summary:
* POST /api/contact — the contact form. Fields stored verbatim when KV (LEADS) is bound;
 * honest `stored:false` + fallback address when not. Nothing inferred, nothing forwarded
 * to third parties.

delete.summary:
* GET/POST /api/webhooks — webhook CRUD (in-memory + KV if bound).
 * GET: returns array of { id, url, events, active, created_at }
 * POST: creates new webhook with { url, events }
 * DELETE: ?id=X r

